{"lang":"mt","dir":"ltr","text":{"credits.donateTitle":"Għinuna nżommu t-tagħlim b’xejn","credits.donateButton":"Appoġġja lil AOSSIE","credits.data":"Data","credits.photos":"Ritratti tal-bliet kapitali","credits.otherPhotos":"Ritratti ta’ frott, annimali u minerali","madeBy":"magħmul minn"},"html":{"credits.lead":"Memo huwa software b’xejn u open source minn <a href=\"https://aossie.org/\">AOSSIE</a>.","credits.source":"Kodiċi sors: <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame\">github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame</a>.","credits.donateText":"AOSSIE hija organizzazzjoni mingħajr skop ta’ qligħ. Memo m’għandux reklami jew abbonamenti u qatt ma jiġbor id-data tiegħek — u rridu nżommuh hekk għal kull tifel u tifla, kullimkien. Jekk Memo qanqal il-kurżità ta’ wliedek dwar id-dinja, jekk jogħġbok ikkunsidra li tixtrilna kafè: kull donazzjoni, kemm jekk kbira u kemm jekk żgħira, tgħinna nibnu u nżommu aktar apps edukattivi b’xejn. Kontribuzzjonijiet ta’ kodiċi, ideat, traduzzjonijiet u feedback huma milqugħa daqstant ieħor!","credits.shapes":"Stampi tal-forom: imfassla għal Memo, b’xejn biex jintużaw bħall-bqija tal-app.","credits.photoSets":"Ritratti ta’ frott, annimali u minerali: minn <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, magħżula permezz ta’ <a href=\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\">Wikipedia</a> u <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a>; isimhom f’kull lingwa: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0).","credits.flags":"Bnadar: minn <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, li jieħuhom minn <a href=\"https://github.com/hampusborgos/country-flags\">hampusborgos/country-flags</a> (dominju pubbliku).","credits.capitals":"Il-bliet kapitali u r-ritratti tagħhom: minn <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, li jieħuhom minn <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0) u <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>.","cre